WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000
Add nitrate and define the budget

00:14.000 --> 00:46.000
Follow nitrogen out of the water

00:46.000 --> 01:06.000
Separate accumulated uptake from rate

01:06.000 --> 01:28.000
Calculate an interval rate

01:28.000 --> 01:52.000
Follow time along the uptake curve

01:52.000 --> 02:12.000
Compare experimental methods

02:12.000 --> 02:24.000
Predict a second pulse

02:24.000 --> 02:46.000
Restore nitrate and test recovery

02:46.000 --> 03:02.000
Double biomass, keep concentration fixed

03:02.000 --> 03:16.000
Sampling is not uptake

03:16.000 --> 03:24.000
Next: form and nutrient supply
